  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram below shows a simple model of five energy levels in an atom. An electron transitions from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{4}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{2}\"></span> and a photon is emitted.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>Which transition results in the emission of a photon of shorter wavelength?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{5}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{3}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{5}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{3}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
